# Build provenance (informational; the gate checks the two blocks above and,
# inside each .so, the identity string). The bytes come from the committed
# recipe scripts/build-htp-skels.sh + scripts/htp-skels-container.sh: container
# image ghcr.io/snapdragon-toolchain/arm64-android:v0.7 (linux/amd64, source =
# git archive of HEAD extracted at the recipe's fixed path /tmp/kalsa-htp/src,
# never bind-mounted); Hexagon SDK 6.6.0.0, Hexagon Tools 19.0.07
# (hexagon-clang); standalone htp project (ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/htp), per-DSP
# -DDSP_VERSION=<v> -DPREBUILT_LIB_DIR=toolv19_<v>, HEXAGON_HTP_DEBUG=OFF,
# Release; Ninja; per-DSP build retry x3. Host-side stub (QAIC output compiled
# into the Android host backend) refreshed from the same run:
# htp/v73/htp_iface{,_stub} (tracked; byte-identical across runs).
TOOLCHAIN_SDK=6.6.0.0
TOOLCHAIN_CLANG=19.0.07
